# winoracle (Windows 11 26200, Microsoft Basic Render Driver / WARP), 2026-09-28.
# x64 and x86 builds print identical lines, twice each (deterministic). The '# d3d11_share_ers_probe (N-bit)'
# banner is the only bitness-dependent line and is a comment.
# Notes: an OPENED STAGING resource does not Map (E_OUTOFMEMORY) -- only its creator's does -- but GPU
# copies into and out of the opening reach the creator's storage. NTHANDLE refuses cube, MSAA, B5G6R5,
# Texture1D, Texture3D and buffers. RESTRICT_SHARED_RESOURCE: another process's open is E_INVALIDARG
# (the creating process opens it); WARP applies no RESTRICT_SHARED_RESOURCE_DRIVER restriction.
# d3d11_share_ers_probe (64-bit)
[cases] create/handle/open on device B, then the child process
